    "final": "Lowest buyable size-XS price for the Quenby tee: $11.35, charged by Ashgrove Clothing Co (http://localhost:7770/igr-rp28-28.html). I opened all 45 tee listings in the search results (36 on page 1 and 9 on page 2) and checked the XS option on each. 7 listings offer no XS at all (Pentland, Brindle, Thornbury, Lymington, Redhill, Carnforth, Gisburn) and 7 have XS disabled/out of stock (Bramley, Oakfield, Everleigh, Fairhaven, Marlow, Dovercourt, Rookwood), so they cannot be bought in XS. Of the 31 buyable XS options, the lowest is Ashgrove at $11.35 (verified by adding XS to the cart, which charged exactly $11.35); next cheapest were Pembroke $12.58, Fordwich $12.70, Garrick $13.10.",
